vaultbot_backend/kokoro_models/
vaultbot_backend/stt_models/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The vault itself - the USER'S mind
# The vault is personal knowledge, chat history, directives, and notes.
# A baseline vault ships empty; each user grows their own.
# These hierarchical folders are where VaultBot writes its output:
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
00-Identity/Auto-Resume-Directive.md
00-Identity/Autonomy-Directive.md
00-Identity/IDK-Fallback-Directive.md
00-Identity/No-Wikipedia-Directive.md
00-Identity/Vault-Knowledge-Only-Directive.md
00-Identity/Fractal-Entropy-Principle.md
00-Identity/Sean-Communication-Preferences.md
00-Identity/Self-Edit-Verification-Directive.md

06-Playbooks/
07-Research/
08-Biology/
08-Chat/
09-Textbooks/

# Old flat-layout vault contents (pre-hierarchical reorg)
vaultbot/chat/
vaultbot/research/
vaultbot/textbooks/
vaultbot/*.md
vaultbot/maintenance.log

# Personal root directives + notes (operator relationship with their bot)
2026-*.md
*-Directive.md
*-Communication-Preferences.md
*-Principle.md
*-Path-to-AGI.md
*-Quality-Gate.md
*-Longevity-Architecture.md
*-Roadmap.md
*-Patterns.md
Sean-*.md
Calibration-via-Operator-Feedback.md
Cross-Session-Patterns-*.md
GOALS.md
LICENSE

